WEBVTT

00:17:59.733 --> 00:18:04.084
So, we built the institution 
and provided the training,

00:18:04.607 --> 00:18:08.857
and the policy to provide
all those opportunities

00:18:08.857 --> 00:18:13.087
for them to be able to do that.

00:18:13.321 --> 00:18:17.559
And I think the fourth 
very important element, in my opinion,

00:18:17.559 --> 00:18:19.135
is partnership

00:18:19.135 --> 00:18:23.241
because I think all the challenges
that the world is facing right now

00:18:23.241 --> 00:18:26.906
cannot be addressed 
and dealt with by one institution.

00:18:26.906 --> 00:18:29.496
That's why I think 
we do a lot of partnerships

00:18:29.496 --> 00:18:30.946
of extended research team